---
// Footer.astro
---

<footer class="bg-[#182C38] text-white pt-20 pb-12 border-t border-slate-700/60 relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Subtle background glow -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[700px] h-[300px] bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse,rgba(107,165,200,0.15)_0%,transparent_70%)] blur-2xl"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 pb-16 border-b border-slate-700/60">
      
      <!-- Brand Col (Cols 1-5) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 p-1 flex items-center justify-center border border-white/20">
            <img src="/logo.svg" alt="SmartSavings Logo" class="w-full h-full object-contain" />
          </div>
          <span class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">
            Smart<span class="text-[#6BA5C8]">Savings</span>
          </span>
        </a>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Tu asistente financiero inteligente en WhatsApp. Detén la fuga de dinero quincenal mediante registro casi sin fricción de voz, texto y recibos con IA.
        </p>

        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-500/40 text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-300">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#2ECC71] animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>Sistema Operativo en WhatsApp: +57 333 293 7647</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links (Cols 6-8) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-[#7FBDA3]">Navegación</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300 font-medium">
          <li><a href="#como-funciona" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Cómo Funciona</a></li>
          <li><a href="#ecosistema-3d" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Ecosistema 3D</a></li>
          <li><a href="#simulador" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Simulador en Vivo</a></li>
          <li><a href="#calculadora" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Calculadora de Fuga</a></li>
          <li><a href="#comparativa" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Comparativa WhatsApp</a></li>
          <li><a href="#precios" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Precios Beta</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Preguntas Frecuentes</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Tech & Security (Cols 9-12) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-[#D4A574]">Seguridad & Stack</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Infraestructura multi-agente construida sobre PostgreSQL en Supabase, orquestada con n8n y modelos de IA avanzados (Gemini 2.5 Flash, DeepSeek y Whisper). Cero claves bancarias compartidas.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a 
            href="https://wa.me/573332937647" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#25D366] to-[#128C7E] text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-md hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
          >
            <span>Iniciar Conversación Oficial</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
      <div>
        © 2026 SmartSavings. Todos los derechos reservados.
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Privacidad de Datos</a>
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Términos de Servicio</a>
        <span class="text-[#7FBDA3]">Hecho con ❤️ para tu tranquilidad financiera</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Floating Sticky WhatsApp Button (Bottom Right) -->
  <a 
    href="https://wa.me/573332937647" 
    target="_blank" 
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50 group flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#25D366] text-white p-3.5 sm:px-5 sm:py-3.5 rounded-full shadow-2xl shadow-emerald-500/40 hover:bg-[#20ba59] hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all"
    aria-label="Abrir WhatsApp con SmartSavings"
  >
    <svg class="w-6 h-6 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/>
    </svg>
    <span class="hidden sm:inline font-bold text-xs">Chatear con el Bot</span>
  </a>

</footer>
